# ── Private user data — must NEVER be committed ─────────────────────────────
# The skill keeps ALL per-user state in COMPANION_HOME (default ~/.companion),
# which lives OUTSIDE this repo, so a fresh install always starts from scratch.
# The patterns below are a defensive backstop in case someone points
# COMPANION_HOME inside the repo or runs the scripts from here.
.companion/
COMPANION_HOME/
state/
journal/
profile.yaml
consent.yaml
continuity.yaml
index.jsonl
*.backup.json
